<title>USA: Connecticut $150 mln transportation bonds priced.</title>
<headline>Connecticut $150 mln transportation bonds priced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities Inc said it priced $150 million of Connecticut special tax obligations bonds transportation infrastructure purpose, 1996 Series B, with a top yield of 5.675 percent.</p>
<p>Maturities 2000-2016 are MBIA insured.  </p>
